msgstr "[2] Hartnett, G. S., Najafi, K. S., Khindanov, A., Liao, H., Schutzman, M., Hush, M. R., Biercuk, M. J., & Baum, Y. (2026). Fast, accurate, high-resolution simulation of large-scale Fermi-Hubbard models on a digital quantum processor. *arXiv:2605.04025*.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr ""
